div class="map-inspector-actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-map-toggle-branch disabled>Collapse branch</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-map-copy hidden>Copy source link</button></div><form method="post" action="/loader.php?view=research" data-research-action="research_step" data-map-focus>'.$csrf.'<input type="hidden" name="action" value="research_step"><input type="hidden" name="run_id" value="'.$run.'"><input type="hidden" name="focus_node_id"><label for="map-focus-note" class="form-label">Focus for this search only (optional)</label><textarea id="map-focus-note" class="form-control" name="focus_note" rows="2" maxlength="1000" placeholder="For example: find counter-evidence"></textarea><button class="btn btn-primary" data-map-search disabled>Search this direction</button><p data-map-focus-help>Available during Evidence with a remaining planned search. No new search slots are added.</p></form><form method="post" action="/loader.php?view=research" data-research-action="research_learn" data-map-learn>'.$csrf.'<input type="hidden" name="source_selection_explicit" value="1"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="research_learn"><input type="hidden" name="run_id" value="'.$run.'"><input type="hidden" name="learn_action" value="explain"><div data-map-source-inputs></div><button class="btn btn-outline-primary" data-map-learn-button disabled>Learn from selected sources</button></form></aside></div><div class="map-review" data-map-review hidden><p>Unchecked prior — choose the claims to verify. Excluded claims stay visible and cannot be restored to this run after Continue.</p><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-map-select="all">Select all</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-map-select="none">Select none</button><span data-map-selection-count role="status"></span><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-map-continue>Continue with selected claims</button></div><p class="map-evidence-help" tabindex="0" data-map-evidence-help hidden>Select a claim or linked dead end and choose Search this direction, or use Continue next phase for the planned search. Each search uses a remaining slot; at most two searches per run.</p></section>';
